{
  "bodyHash": "5463556b69c00bf7",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>BrassAmber Mods组织的项目：</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050784/description_a424b8b7-296b-47a1-b6a6-5eb8d269f545.png\" width=\"178\" height=\"178\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如有疑问或需获取更多信息，</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/excaliburs-crate-beta\" rel=\"nofollow\">Muul: Entropy &amp; Creation</a><strong>，</strong>一个面向1.20.1版本的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.technicpack.net%252fmodpack%252fyogbox.552680\" rel=\"nofollow\">YogBox</a>&nbsp;复兴整合包的一部分。<br>加入我们的Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/PTeDmqUzq9\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/PTeDmqUzq9</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong>隆重推出：</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong>黄铜琥珀战斗塔（BrassAmber BattleTowers）！</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/724/243/ba-bt-20-3d.png\" width=\"1047\" height=\"589\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>支持版本：</strong></span><em><strong><br></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>1.16.5：陆地之塔</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>&nbsp;1.18.2：陆地/海洋之塔</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>1.20.1：陆地/海洋/核心之塔</strong></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">庆祝战斗塔模组诞生15周年！<br></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">致敬2010年经典模组制作精神！<br><br>历经两代传承：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>[KodaichiZero -&gt; AtomicStryker -&gt; Brass_McCrafty &amp; sMilamber ]</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>战斗塔现已正式回归！</strong></em></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>“我注意到原版模组称它们为守护者，于是便沿用了这一称呼” —— Brass_McCrafty</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><strong>“</strong></em><em><strong>BrassAmber Battle Towers 强调</strong></em><em><strong>进度推进与隐藏剧情</strong></em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><strong>以及通过各Boss的</strong></em><em><strong><em>招式机制来逐步提升难度。</em></strong></em></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><strong><em>钥匙与方尖碑等新机制的引入，旨在</em></strong></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><strong><em>修复严重漏洞与浮空傀儡问题，同时减缓</em></strong></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><strong><em>塔的推进节奏，鼓励玩家探索而非速通。”</em></strong></strong></em></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>踏入6座宏伟巨塔，体验循序渐进的挑战</strong></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/498/47/keys.png\" width=\"654\" height=\"109\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>直面6位严酷无情的塔之守护者</strong></strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/498/48/eyes.png\" width=\"654\" height=\"109\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>获取塔之共鸣石，一种集多重功能、音律共鸣与生命充能于一体的水晶</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/498/49/resonance_stones.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"722\" height=\"109\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在暮色森林（Twilight Forest）与天堂（Aether）中挑战全新塔楼与守护者！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>[即将推出]</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/731/937/screenshot_2023-09-20_133244.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>沉浸于Battle Towers专属的14首震撼配乐之中</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>音乐鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Battle Towers原声带共包含14首曲目</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">傀儡/塔楼背景音乐由：RotchGwylt 创作</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW-dK8RVFOste3gk-BZhqyw\" rel=\"nofollow\">--------</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW-dK8RVFOste3gk-BZhqyw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rotch Gwylt - YouTube</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW-dK8RVFOste3gk-BZhqyw\" rel=\"nofollow\">--------</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>守护者共鸣状态：</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;8/8 已完成</strong></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/634/547/tower_guardian_resonance_2.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></strong></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-陆地守护者：<strong>Bahryn'muul之怒</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-海洋守护者：<strong>Moraizu'un虚空</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-核心神明：<strong>Obthu'uryn苏醒</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-下界守护者：<strong>Infuur'niir王座</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-末地守护者：<strong>Shul'losniir思绪</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-天空女神：<strong>Veyhz'kriin降临</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">守护者陨落：<strong>少一位守护者</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">主菜单：<strong>塔之守护者共鸣</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/542294/description_b2a0ea9a-60a1-4df4-affe-7c049c0195d3.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"261\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">战斗塔信号接收：<strong style=\"font-size:24px\">6/6 已完成</strong></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-陆地塔：<strong>强制庇护</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-海洋塔：<strong>虚空充氧</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-核心塔：<strong>熔岩劫难</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-下界塔：<strong>烈焰天罚</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-末地塔：<strong>诡异启示</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-天空塔：<strong>共鸣悬浮</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">全体鸣谢：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>美术：<strong>Brass_McCrafty</strong>，灵感来源于 <strong>Matt</strong>（即 <strong>Maffhew</strong>）的 <strong>Dillow's Excalibur</strong> 资源包</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>音乐：<br>1.20.1 塔楼与傀儡音乐由 <strong>Rotch Gwylt</strong> 制作<br>1.18.2 及以下版本：塔楼音乐由 <strong>LudoCrypt</strong> 制作，傀儡音乐由 <strong>Rotch Gwylt</strong> 制作</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>塔楼设计：<strong>Brass_McCrafty</strong> &amp; <strong>Milamber</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>房间设计：<strong>Milamber</strong>、<strong>PlsLetMeRest</strong> &amp; <strong>Brass_McCrafty</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>优化塔楼生成逻辑：<strong>Milamber</strong> [感谢Atomic夸奖Milamber的代码，Atomic &lt;3]</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>重构傀儡AI：<strong>Milamber</strong>、X<strong>rated_junior</strong> &amp; <strong>DerToaster</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>重构塔楼坍塌效果：<strong>Milamber</strong> &amp; <strong>DerToaster</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">前维护者 - AtomicStryker：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atomicstrykers-battle-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">AtomicStryker's Battle Towers - Mods - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原作者 - KodaichiZero：<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/mods-discussion/1344868-mod-battle-towers-betav1-new-rarity-patch\" rel=\"nofollow\">[MOD] Battle Towers BetaV1 - Minecraft Forum</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>本模组使用 Excalibur 资源包制作&nbsp;</em></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在此下载 Excalibur：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/Thwj88Ny\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/Thwj88Ny</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">常见问题解答（FAQ）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：<strong>你们支持第三方启动器 X 吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：不支持。我们不允许通过其他第三方平台进行下载。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：<strong>为什么 /locate 命令无法使用？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：CurseForge上发布的最新测试版终于修复了此问题！<br>beta3.2.1 之前的版本仍存在该问题。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：<strong>什么时候出Fabric版？<br>答：暂无计划。你可以尝试Draylar制作的Battle Towers作为Fabric替代方案。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问：<strong>我找不到任何塔楼！<br>答：请查看模组的配置文件，并修改 <strong>[First-tower-distance]</strong> 及平均间距字段。&nbsp;<br><br>问：<strong>我在哪里可以反馈Bug？&nbsp;</strong><br>答：请使用此处的GitHub Issue追踪器：<a href=\"https://github.com/BrassAmber-Mods/Brass_Amber_BattleTowers/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brass_Amber_BattleTowers/issues</a><br><br>问：<strong>x版本何时发布？</strong><br>答：加入我们的Discord以获取模组更新资讯：<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/cyKxnyAbYV&amp;nbsp;</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Что делать с глазом стража?<br></strong> Ответ: Глаза являются ключом к монолиту следующей башни. Например, Глаз Голема Наземной Башни используется для открытия монолита Океанской башни.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Версия 1.18.2:<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Как открыть сундуки в башне?</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ: Разбейте все спавнеры на этаже, чтобы открыть сундук на этом этаже.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Как активировать Монолит?</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ:&nbsp; После разрушения достаточного количества спавнеров в сундуке следующего этажа появится ключ. Соберите 3 (для Наземной башни) или 2 (для остальных башен) и поместите их в Монолит, чтобы призвать Голема.<br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Куда делись таблицы лута башни??</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ:&nbsp; Таблицы лута для сундуков башни теперь можно найти в файле конфигурации мода.</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Почему не работает команда /locate?</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ: Из-за способа генерации башен [истинная случайность] это не работает. Ищите их, и вы их найдёте!.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>В: Можете ли вы сделать обратное портирование на версию x?</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ. Нет. Обратное портирование любого вида стоит в самом низу списка задач, так как разработка на новых версиях проще для всех участников, поэтому не спрашивайте. Мы займёмся этим, когда дойдём до этого</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Версия 1.16.5:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">В: <strong>Как открыть сундуки в башне?</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ответ: Разбейте 2 спавнера на этаже, чтобы открыть сундук на этом этаже.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>В: <strong>Как активировать Монолит?</strong><br>Ответ: В сундуках на 5, 6 и 8 этажах находятся ключи. Поместите их в Монолит, чтобы призвать Голема.</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
